--- !u!114 &75275410
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 75275407}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d57edf726d7ecd34c89b14ffebe53380, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPCDialogue
  npcName: Yaroslava
  startNode: start
  addGoodbye: 1
  wrongItemReply: I don't see what that has to do with anything.
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  talkingPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  faceHeightAdjust: 0
  headHeightAdjust: 0
  nodes:
  - id: start
    npcText: Ah, the detective. Come to stare at the old woman like everyone else? Go on, then.
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - text: What are you selling?
      nextNode: wares
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - text: Did you see what happened to Geno?
      nextNode: geno
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    timeLimit: 0
    timeoutNode: 
  - id: wares
    npcText: Charms. Tonics. Things that work, unlike that certified girl's watery nonsense.
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - text: You mean Carmela?
      nextNode: carmela
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - text: I had other questions.
      nextNode: start
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 0
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    timeLimit: 0
    timeoutNode: 
  - id: carmela
    npcText: A license doesn't make you a true witch, dearie.
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - text: Noted
      nextNode: Start
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    timeLimit: 0
    timeoutNode: 
  - id: geno
    npcText: I saw a man who invented things he shouldn't have. Inventors like that always have enemies. And debts.
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - text: What kind of enemies?
      nextNode: enemies
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - text: I had other questions.
      nextNode: start
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 0
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    timeLimit: 0
    timeoutNode: 
  - id: enemies
    npcText: The kind that don't come to the front door. Ask around about the waterfront, if you're brave.
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - text: I will.
      nextNode: start
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    timeLimit: 0
    timeoutNode: 
  - id: scaleMafia
    npcText: The ones who run the waterfront. You don't sell scales unless they say you can. And they never say you can.
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - text: Good to know.
      nextNode: start
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    timeLimit: 0
    timeoutNode: 
  - id: keepBusy
    npcText: Someone who smells like low tide, dearie. Now, do me a favor. Keep Murray busy for a few minutes. Don't ask why.
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - text: ...Fine.
      nextNode: 
      endConversation: 1
      greyAfterChosen: 0
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: Why does she want Murray distracted?
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls:
          - m_Target: {fileID: 1299698502}
            m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: NPCDialogue, Assembly-CSharp
            m_MethodName: UnlockChoice
            m_Mode: 5
            m_Arguments:
              m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
              m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
              m_IntArgument: 0
              m_FloatArgument: 0
              m_StringArgument: DistractMurray
              m_BoolArgument: 0
            m_CallState: 2
    timeLimit: 0
    timeoutNode: 
  - id: handover
    npcText: Fine! Fine. It's no use to me anyway. I can't make the stupid thing work
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - text: Thank you
      nextNode: 
      endConversation: 1
      greyAfterChosen: 0
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls:
          - m_Target: {fileID: 514267739}
            m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: Grabbable, Assembly-CSharp
            m_MethodName: MoveTo
            m_Mode: 2
            m_Arguments:
              m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 1172608156}
              m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Transform, UnityEngine
              m_IntArgument: 0
              m_FloatArgument: 0
              m_StringArgument: DistractMurray
              m_BoolArgument: 0
            m_CallState: 2
    timeLimit: 0
    timeoutNode: 
  eventDialogue:
  - unlockId: 
    showInNode: 
    text: Do you know what this is?
    requiredItem: {fileID: 101083546}
    npcReply: Oh. Oh, my. A Fishman's scale. Grind one down and the right buyer pays a fortune. The mafia guards those like gold.
    choices:
    - text: The mafia?
      nextNode: scaleMafia
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 0
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    backText: 
    greyAfterChosen: 0
    nextNode: 
    endConversation: 0
    salemThinks: 
    onChosen:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - unlockId: 
    showInNode: 
    text: What do you make of this?
    requiredItem: {fileID: 1012264499}
    npcReply: Give that here! No, no, I only want a look. Peixe dust, in a sardine tin. Of course it is.
    choices:
    - text: Who'd carry something like this?
      nextNode: keepBusy
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 0
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    backText: 
    greyAfterChosen: 0
    nextNode: 
    endConversation: 0
    salemThinks: 
    onChosen:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - unlockId: ToolStolen
    showInNode: 
    text: What did you take from Murray?
    requiredItem: {fileID: 0}
    npcReply: Take? Me? Nothing at all, dearie. An old woman doesn't take things.
    choices:
    - text: Empty your pockets.
      nextNode: handover
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    backText: 
    greyAfterChosen: 0
    nextNode: 
    endConversation: 0
    salemThinks: 
    onChosen:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
