--- !u!114 &433625671
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 433625670}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5fb56ceabffb7374bbc6b1c0f06eefba, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::IntroCutscene
  startMode: 0
  pauseGame: 1
  canSkip: 1
  startingBackground: {fileID: -3091458663278636600, guid: 4ab2054af7e63a544aa1385d4abc5599, type: 3}
  cast:
  - name: Police Chief
    portrait: {fileID: -5028693540622827774, guid: 86ac7ffa64e022745bd5b908c00a745a, type: 3}
    talkingPortrait: {fileID: -8451752369490405339, guid: 6a6fe43e5c30c1a43ad5b786ff94cbc2, type: 3}
  - name: Salem
    portrait: {fileID: 2449090133660841456, guid: 9358f7fe58ad18c4aa6f44d83eb18505, type: 3}
    talkingPortrait: {fileID: 9213819040481710246, guid: 7c0819f092bdba14391835f486dc89ab, type: 3}
  lines:
  - text: Hotel Eclipse. Late Thursday night.
    speaker: 
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    background: {fileID: 0}
    profile: 
    effect: 0
  - text: Salem. Good, you're here. We have another one.
    speaker: Police Chief
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    background: {fileID: 0}
    profile: 
    effect: 0
  - text: The victim is *Geno Jones*. Found right here in this Hotel, nearly split in two.
    speaker: Police Chief
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    background: {fileID: 0}
    profile: 
    effect: 1
  - text: Geno was a *master inventor of supernatural tools*. Half the protective charms in this city came out of his workshop.
    speaker: Police Chief
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    background: {fileID: 0}
    profile: 
    effect: 0
  - text: Not exactly a saint, though. He sold to whoever paid and made plenty of enemies doing it.
    speaker: Police Chief
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    background: {fileID: 0}
    profile: 
    effect: 0
  - text: Time of death was *10:00 pm*. The wounds point to *large claws*. Whatever did this wasn't human.
    speaker: Police Chief
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    background: {fileID: 0}
    profile: 
    effect: 0
  - text: I pieced together what I could from *multiple staff accounts*. Nobody saw the attack itself.
    speaker: Police Chief
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    background: {fileID: 0}
    profile: 
    effect: 0
  - text: But they all agree on one thing. At 10:00, *six guests* were in this lounge.
    speaker: Police Chief
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    background: {fileID: 0}
    profile: 
    effect: 0
  - text: So whoever did this is still in the room.
    speaker: Salem
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    background: {fileID: 0}
    profile: 
    effect: 0
  - text: Exactly. Six suspects. Here's what I have on each of them.
    speaker: Police Chief
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    background: {fileID: 0}
    profile: 
    effect: 0
  - text: '*James*. Tech billionaire, in town for a business meeting. Cold as ice, and not happy we''re keeping him here.'
    speaker: Police Chief
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    background: {fileID: 0}
    profile: James
    effect: 0
  - text: '*Helena*. James''s girlfriend. She hasn''t stopped crying since we got here.'
    speaker: Police Chief
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    background: {fileID: 0}
    profile: Helena
    effect: 0
  - text: '*Carmela*. A certified witch who brews healing potions. Says she was called here to deliver a sobering tonic.'
    speaker: Police Chief
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    background: {fileID: 0}
    profile: Carmela
    effect: 0
  - text: '*Zain*. Been drinking since before we arrived. Used to work for James''s company.'
    speaker: Police Chief
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    background: {fileID: 0}
    profile: Zain
    effect: 0
  - text: '*Murray*. Says he''s a businessman. Sells fancy caviar.'
    speaker: Police Chief
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    background: {fileID: 0}
    profile: Murray
    effect: 0
  - text: '*Yaroslava*. Sells potions and amulets. Not certified, and she''ll tell you what she thinks of witches who are.'
    speaker: Police Chief
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    background: {fileID: 0}
    profile: Yaroslava
    effect: 0
  - text: One more thing. Trust no one. And from the early reports, there may be *more than one monster*.
    speaker: Police Chief
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    background: {fileID: 0}
    profile: 
    effect: 2
  - text: Talk to them, find the evidence, and only accuse someone when you're sure. *One wrong guess*, and you'll end up like Geno.
    speaker: Police Chief
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    background: {fileID: 0}
    profile: 
    effect: 1
  - text: I'll be outside. Good luck, Detective.
    speaker: Police Chief
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    background: {fileID: 0}
    profile: 
    effect: 0
  - text: Time to get to work.
    speaker: Salem
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    background: {fileID: 0}
    profile: 
    effect: 0
  profiles:
  - name: Helena
    role: "James's girlfriend  \xB7  Socialite"
    description: 'Here with James on his business trip. Dramatic and tearful. '
    picture: {fileID: 3160117112878298474, guid: deb14f9535641334e961751fa801c045, type: 3}
  - name: James
    role: "Tech billionaire  \xB7  Helena's boyfriend"
    description: In town for an important business meeting. Cold, logical and dismissive.
    picture: {fileID: -8994794203564314929, guid: 027a2d6ddc26d5140ac1549d72e90922, type: 3}
  - name: Carmela
    role: "Certified witch  \xB7  Potion maker"
    description: Called to the hotel to deliver a sobering tonic to a drunk guest. Paranoid and avoids confrontation.
    picture: {fileID: -2366672168162998563, guid: 444fbdd0a90e82240a0693405908efd4, type: 3}
  - name: Zain
    role: Hotel guest
    description: Drinking heavily. Lost his job at James's company.
    picture: {fileID: -5991773803308952700, guid: 6db7bf0271cd7fe4d8704660acc46524, type: 3}
  - name: Murray
    role: "Businessman  \xB7  Caviar distributor"
    description: Ships expensive caviar in signature tins.
    picture: {fileID: 7778993058420067397, guid: b853d6b764345d345b0415467a43cc61, type: 3}
  - name: Yaroslava
    role: Potion and amulet seller
    description: Uncertified magic practitioner. Bitter toward certified witches.
    picture: {fileID: 3753159925019793023, guid: 1638a536b12a3604fab873375da5f142, type: 3}
  lettersPerSecond: 40
  sentencePause: 0.3
  commaPause: 0.1
  flapInterval: 0.2
  onFinished:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  matchDialogueBox: 1
