--- !u!114 &1299698502
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1299698499}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d57edf726d7ecd34c89b14ffebe53380, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPCDialogue
  npcName: Murray
  startNode: start
  addGoodbye: 1
  wrongItemReply: I don't see what that has to do with anything.
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  talkingPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  faceHeightAdjust: 0
  headHeightAdjust: 0
  nodes:
  - id: start
    npcText: Im Murray. I export caviar and fine tinned goods. Anything I can do, you just ask.
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - text: What brings you to Hotel Eclipse?
      nextNode: business
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - text: Did you know Geno Jones?
      nextNode: geno
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - text: You've kept well away from the fire tonight.
      nextNode: fire
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    timeLimit: 0
    timeoutNode: 
  - id: business
    npcText: I move product from the waterfront to the finest tables in the city. Nobody gets it there faster. Or quieter.
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - text: Quieter?
      nextNode: quiet
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - text: I had other questions
      nextNode: start
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 0
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    timeLimit: 0
    timeoutNode: 
  - id: quiet
    npcText: Discretion, Detective. Rich people like their delicacies to arrive without a fuss. Nothing more to it.
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - text: Of course.
      nextNode: Start
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    timeLimit: 0
    timeoutNode: 
  - id: geno
    npcText: Only by reputation. Clever man. Made all sorts of gadgets. I hear he poked his nose into things that weren't his business.
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - text: Whose business?
      nextNode: genoPush
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - text: I had other questions
      nextNode: start
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 0
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    timeLimit: 0
    timeoutNode: 
  - id: genoPush
    npcText: 'Couldn''t tell you. I''m just here for the caviar.

'
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - text: Right
      nextNode: start
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    timeLimit: 0
    timeoutNode: 
  - id: fire
    npcText: Dry skin. The heat doesn't agree with me. You'd be surprised how much that matters in my line of work.
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - text: Your line of work?
      nextNode: business
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - text: I had other questions.
      nextNode: start
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 0
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    timeLimit: 0
    timeoutNode: 
  - id: distract1
    npcText: Caviar? Now you're speaking my language. What do you want to know?
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - text: Where does the best stuff come from?
      nextNode: distract2
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - text: Isn't it just fish eggs?
      nextNode: lostHim
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - text: Why do you keep watching Zain?
      nextNode: lostHim
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    timeLimit: 6
    timeoutNode: lostHim
  - id: distract2
    npcText: The waterfront, my friend. Cold water, patient men. Most people never see how it's done.
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - text: Sounds like smuggling.
      nextNode: lostHim
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - text: Tell me how it's done.
      nextNode: distract3
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    timeLimit: 6
    timeoutNode: lostHim
  - id: distract3
    npcText: Ha! Pull up a stool. It all starts with the tins, see. The tin is everything...
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - text: Sorry, I need to check on something.
      nextNode: lostHim
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - text: Go on, I'm listening.
      nextNode: distracted
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    timeLimit: 6
    timeoutNode: lostHim
  - id: distracted
    npcText: ...and that's why nobody opens a sardine tin they didn't pack themselves. Listen to me, talking your ear off.
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - text: Thanks for your time.
      nextNode: 
      endConversation: 1
      greyAfterChosen: 0
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: Yaroslava looks awfully pleased with herself.
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls:
          - m_Target: {fileID: 75275410}
            m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: NPCDialogue, Assembly-CSharp
            m_MethodName: UnlockChoice
            m_Mode: 5
            m_Arguments:
              m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
              m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
              m_IntArgument: 0
              m_FloatArgument: 0
              m_StringArgument: ToolStolen
              m_BoolArgument: 0
            m_CallState: 2
    timeLimit: 0
    timeoutNode: 
  - id: lostHim
    npcText: I've got business to attend to, Detective. Excuse me.
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - text: Sure
      nextNode: 
      endConversation: 1
      greyAfterChosen: 0
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    timeLimit: 0
    timeoutNode: 
  - id: revealed
    npcText: Fine. You want to see what's under the suit? Look, then.
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - text: You've been smuggling yourself.
      nextNode: caught
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 0
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    timeLimit: 0
    timeoutNode: 
  - id: caught
    npcText: So I move a little product. I didn't touch the inventor. Whatever split him in half had claws, Detective. Not fins.
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - text: Then who did?
      nextNode: 
      endConversation: 1
      greyAfterChosen: 0
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls:
          - m_Target: {fileID: 1658047868}
            m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: GameComplete, Assembly-CSharp
            m_MethodName: EndGame
            m_Mode: 1
            m_Arguments:
              m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
              m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
              m_IntArgument: 0
              m_FloatArgument: 0
              m_StringArgument: 
              m_BoolArgument: 0
            m_CallState: 2
    timeLimit: 0
    timeoutNode: 
  eventDialogue:
  - unlockId: DistractMurray
    showInNode: 
    text: Got a minute? I want to talk caviar.
    requiredItem: {fileID: 0}
    npcReply: 
    choices: []
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    backText: 
    greyAfterChosen: 1
    nextNode: distract1
    endConversation: 0
    salemThinks: 
    onChosen:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - unlockId: AccuseMurray
    showInNode: 
    text: This came out of Geno's tool. Out of your scale.
    requiredItem: {fileID: 1333084727}
    npcReply: That's... put that away. Do you have any idea what you're holding?
    choices:
    - text: You're the Fishman.
      nextNode: revealed
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 0
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls:
