  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Clue
  thought: Geno's daughter worked for James. This wasn't business for him. It was *personal*.
  noteTitle: Geno's notes, 2
  noteText: "\u2014she wasn't weak. She was worked until the bottle was the only thing that let her sleep, and *J.* signed every one of those schedules. The hospital said one more night and I'd have lost her. I'll make him answ\u2014"
