--- !u!114 &1983400528
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1983400525}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d57edf726d7ecd34c89b14ffebe53380, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPCDialogue
  npcName: James
  startNode: start
  addGoodbye: 1
  wrongItemReply: I don't see what that has to do with anything.
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  talkingPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  faceHeightAdjust: 0
  headHeightAdjust: 0
  nodes:
  - id: Start
    npcText: Detective. I assume you'll be quick. Some of us have actual work to do.
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - text: You don't seem upset about Geno.
      nextNode: upset
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - text: Where were you at 10:00?
      nextNode: alibi
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - text: Tell me about Helena.
      nextNode: helena
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    timeLimit: 0
    timeoutNode: 
  - id: upset
    npcText: Should I be? The man spent years calling my company a 'public health hazard'. Forgive me if I don't weep.
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - text: That's motive.
      nextNode: motive
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - text: I had other questions.
      nextNode: start
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 0
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    timeLimit: 0
    timeoutNode: 
  - id: motive
    npcText: Motive? I have lawyers for people like Geno. I don't need to cut them in half.
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - text: We'll see.
      nextNode: start
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    timeLimit: 0
    timeoutNode: 
  - id: alibi
    npcText: Right here, with Helena, listening to her cry about real estate. Riveting.
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - text: Noted
      nextNode: start
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    timeLimit: 0
    timeoutNode: 
  - id: helena
    npcText: She's emotional. Exhausting, frankly. But useful. People tend to say yes to us.
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - text: Do they.
      nextNode: start
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    timeLimit: 0
    timeoutNode: 
  - id: daughter
    npcText: Lots of people work for me, Detective. I can't be expected to remember all of them. Are we done?
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - text: For now.
      nextNode: start
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    timeLimit: 0
    timeoutNode: 
  - id: charm
    npcText: From the kind of people who ask too many questions. Present company included.
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - text: Charming.
      nextNode: start
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    timeLimit: 0
    timeoutNode: 
  eventDialogue:
  - unlockId: GenoNotes
    showInNode: 
    text: Geno's notes mention you.
    requiredItem: {fileID: 0}
    npcReply: Of course they do. Small men love writing about big ones. Did he at least spell my name right?
    choices:
    - text: He mentions his daughter.
      nextNode: daughter
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    backText: 
    greyAfterChosen: 1
    nextNode: 
    endConversation: 0
    salemThinks: 
    onChosen:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - unlockId: 
    showInNode: 
    text: Ever seen one of these?
    requiredItem: {fileID: 101083546}
    npcReply: A scale? How quaint. I carry one myself, a marked one. A protection charm. It wards off... certain people.
    choices:
    - text: Protection from who?
      nextNode: charm
      endConversation: 0
      greyAfterChosen: 1
      appearAfter: 0
      unlockId: 
      salemThinks: 
      onChosen:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    backText: 
    greyAfterChosen: 1
    nextNode: 
    endConversation: 0
    salemThinks: 
    onChosen:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
